<title>JAPAN: Tobu Railway - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tobu Railway - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		120.16		vs	  128.38</p>
<p> Operating	   18.77		vs	   17.35</p>
<p> Current		7.71		vs	    5.62</p>
<p> Net		     2.5		vs	    2.24</p>
<p> EPS		    2.91 yen	  vs	    2.61 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    859 million	  vs	 859 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Tobu Railway Co Ltd has the longest operating mileage of railway operators in the Kanto area.</p>
